\knowledgeanchor{SLM-06-02-004}{最大熵模型的定义} 对训练集定义频数$
u(x,y)$与$
u(x)$，经验分布为 \widetilde P(x,y)= rac{
u(x,y)}{N},\qquad \widetilde P(x)= rac{
u(x)}{N}. 给定特征$f_i(x,y)$，其经验期望与模型期望分别为 \widetilde E(f_i)=\sum_{x,y}\widetilde P(x,y)f_i(x,y), \qquad E_P(f_i)=\sum_{x,y}\widetilde P(x)P(y\mid x)f_i(x,y).
